doctype html
html
  head
    title Invalid password reset link
    link(rel="stylesheet", href="/assets/css/alarmcal.css")
  body
    h1 Invalid password reset link
    p The password reset link you used is not valid or has expired. Reset links expire 20 minutes after they are requested and can only be used once. Please request a new one from the #[a(href="/login") login page].
    p
      i NOTE: If you did not request this password reset, someone else may have. Please contact the mentor team ASAP if this has happened.
